Z||000003||Oreif||06-13-2001||11:43 PM||||Outlaw Performance is the "You get what you pay for" company. Friend bought the side scoops and they were nasty. Need lots of work. Also their packing is garbage. They just tossed the parts in a box and some foam. Lots of chips and a crack from shipping. Took almost a month and a half to get them. It seems to work better if you Email them at their website address. They tend to respond faster. The quality is poor, shipping is slow, their packing is poor. Even at the lower prices that they sell them on Ebay it still isn't a good deal.<BR>The website is: <A HREF="http://www.outlawperformance.org" TARGET=_blank>www.outlawperformance.org</A> <p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 06-13-2001).]||||reg||13
